WEBVTT

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:55.421
Arusu learns that she can go back
to the Human Realm from a place...

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:57.784
...called the Port of Departure...

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:00.416
...and sets off on a journey with Eva.

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:04.420
But on the way, they are pursued
by the special capture squad...

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:07.330
...then attacked by fairies
in the Forest of No Return...

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.095
...50 it was a journey
filled with peril.

00:01:09.169 --> 00:01:11.228
If Sheila hadn't come to save them...

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:15.070
...I have a feeling that they never
would've made it to the Port of Departure.

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:18.802
But they found that the place was
actually a witches' graveyard.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:50.368
Tweeny Witches

00:02:54.874 --> 00:02:59.402
Witch Evaluation

00:03:04.317 --> 00:03:05.785
Where's Arusu?

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:06.818
I don't know.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.152
Do you think she's all right?

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:10.383
Who knows?

00:03:11.124 --> 00:03:12.614
Go check on her, Sheila.

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:13.591
You want me to?

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:17.654
Well, if you hadn't taken her
to the Port of Departure...

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:20.959
Listen, I tried to stop her.
But she insisted, so I had no choice...

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:22.432
Go check on her!

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:25.900
| can't leave the kitchen right now.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:27.668
Jeez!

00:03:34.614 --> 00:03:36.412
I'm an octopus!

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:39.318
No, no! Over here, over here!

00:03:39.586 --> 00:03:40.451
Here!

00:03:40.753 --> 00:03:41.397
Look, you...

00:03:41.421 --> 00:03:42.164
Look, you...
Hey, Sheila's mad!

00:03:42.188 --> 00:03:43.713
Hey, Sheila's mad!

00:03:45.358 --> 00:03:46.951
You should just get mad!

00:03:47.026 --> 00:03:49.825
Do what you always do.
Furrow your brow here!

00:03:49.963 --> 00:03:51.158
Come on, come on!

00:03:52.065 --> 00:03:53.726
Don't worry. I'm fine.

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:55.961
After a good night's sleep,
| feel better, I guess.

00:03:56.035 --> 00:03:58.834
Even if I did go back to the Human Realm,
I'd just end up being...

00:03:58.938 --> 00:04:01.032
...fun into the ground by
our cram school system.

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:03.268
And if that's the case,
then I might as well learn...

00:04:03.343 --> 00:04:06.677
...how to ace all these magical spells,
and live a fun, exciting life instead.

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:09.914
Anyway, it really throws me
off balance, you know.

00:04:10.016 --> 00:04:12.485
It's not just Eva, but to have
someone like you trying...

00:04:12.552 --> 00:04:13.696
...to cheer me up as well.

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:14.710
...to cheer me up as well.
I'm not trying to...

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:16.619
Oh, do you really mean that?

00:04:16.689 --> 00:04:18.453
| wouldn't, even if I was told to!

00:04:18.658 --> 00:04:19.124
Hey.

00:04:19.192 --> 00:04:21.524
Now I've really made you mad, Sheila!

00:04:22.028 --> 00:04:22.871
Hey! Look, you!

00:04:22.895 --> 00:04:23.657
Hey! Look, you!
Really!

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:27.630
Now, you two! It's time for breakfast.
Stop stirring up all that dust!

00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:31.830
Cancel the witch evaluations?

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:34.164
But it has been held
without fail once a year.

00:04:34.274 --> 00:04:36.174
It's a time-honored tradition.

00:04:36.242 --> 00:04:39.701
You're the one who shattered
that tradition, Atelia.

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:43.544
How can we evaluate everyone
when we don't even have...

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:45.948
...enough fairies on hand?

00:04:46.152 --> 00:04:48.883
| am more than aware that
the responsibility lies with me.

00:04:48.955 --> 00:04:53.358
But already some of the apprentice
witches are beginning to realize...

00:04:53.426 --> 00:04:56.953
...the supply of fairy resources
is no longer abundant.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.928
We must go ahead with
the evaluations as usual...

00:04:59.999 --> 00:05:02.434
...otherwise it could
destroy our authority.

00:05:02.602 --> 00:05:07.062
How many species of fairies
have been recaptured so far?

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.705
That would be 14.

00:05:09.142 --> 00:05:13.409
So I will make sure that at least 20...
No, at the very least 30 of the...

00:05:13.513 --> 00:05:16.710
...fairy species are recaptured
by evaluation day.

00:05:20.653 --> 00:05:24.146
Hey, did you hear? They're canceling
the witch evaluation this year.

00:05:24.223 --> 00:05:26.555
Huh? No way?
How come? How come?

00:05:27.026 --> 00:05:28.585
Are you sure about that?

00:05:28.661 --> 00:05:31.790
Well, I'm sure that works
for you, right, Qoo?

00:05:31.898 --> 00:05:34.629
So you won't be sent to the Human Realm!

00:05:34.734 --> 00:05:36.725
Little ol' slowpoke Qoo!

00:05:38.237 --> 00:05:39.727
Enough of that kind of talk.

00:05:39.806 --> 00:05:43.242
The witch evaluation is a time-honored
tradition in the Witch Realm.

00:05:43.309 --> 00:05:44.936
No way would they cancel it!

00:05:45.011 --> 00:05:46.945
Hey, what is this
witch evaluation thing?

00:05:47.013 --> 00:05:48.447
Uh... well...

00:05:48.548 --> 00:05:49.777
What is it?

00:05:50.049 --> 00:05:52.450
Today we're going to go
over the petrification spell.

00:05:52.819 --> 00:05:56.881
Sheila! Don't tell me that
in order to get this thing, you...

00:05:56.956 --> 00:05:59.584
It's just waste matter.
You got a problem with that?

00:05:59.659 --> 00:06:01.252
Waste... matter?

00:06:01.461 --> 00:06:03.605
It's a culops fairy's belly button lint.

00:06:03.629 --> 00:06:04.221
It's a culops fairy's belly button lint.
Holy...

00:06:04.297 --> 00:06:05.765
Are you serious?

00:06:06.566 --> 00:06:08.762
I'll do it, I'll do it, okay?

00:06:08.868 --> 00:06:10.666
| just have to do it, right?

00:06:11.003 --> 00:06:11.868
Let's see...

00:06:11.971 --> 00:06:12.665
Okay!

00:06:12.905 --> 00:06:17.035
Mountain hut, high leg, rock 'n' roll!

00:06:18.578 --> 00:06:21.604
Hey, am I awesome or what?
On my first try too!

00:06:21.681 --> 00:06:24.548
That's amazing! I knew you had
areal talent for this, Arusu!

00:06:24.617 --> 00:06:25.361
It's called heresy.

00:06:25.385 --> 00:06:26.784
It's called heresy.
What was that you just said?

00:06:26.853 --> 00:06:28.252
That mountain hut whatever?

00:06:28.321 --> 00:06:29.482
It's mnemonics!

00:06:29.555 --> 00:06:32.320
Arusu thought it up!
Doesn't it make it easier to remember?

00:06:32.392 --> 00:06:32.950
Hey...

00:06:33.126 --> 00:06:35.618
Mountain hut, high leg, rock 'n" roll!

00:06:35.695 --> 00:06:37.940
| said, that kind of thing is heresy!
Mountain hut, high leg, rock 'n" roll!

00:06:37.964 --> 00:06:38.658
Mountain hut, high leg, rock 'n" roll!

00:06:38.765 --> 00:06:39.041
Magic is a tradition, you know!

00:06:39.065 --> 00:06:40.542
Magic is a tradition, you know!
Mountain hut, high leg, rock 'n" roll!

00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:40.709
Mountain hut, high leg, rock 'n" roll!

00:06:40.733 --> 00:06:42.311
You can't pass the evaluation like that!
Mountain hut, high leg, rock 'n" roll!

00:06:42.335 --> 00:06:42.378
You can't pass the evaluation like that!

00:06:42.402 --> 00:06:43.528
You can't pass the evaluation like that!
Oh, come on.

00:06:43.603 --> 00:06:45.594
Don't be such a stiff now!

00:06:45.671 --> 00:06:48.538
Let's try to have a good time!
If we can all master this magic stuff...

00:06:48.641 --> 00:06:50.905
...you'll be okay, we'll be okay,
and Bob's your uncle!

00:06:50.977 --> 00:06:52.672
Was that a mantra too?

00:06:52.779 --> 00:06:55.441
No, that happened to be
a play on words, my dear...

00:06:55.548 --> 00:06:57.573
| can't believe you're
spreading nonsense like that.

00:06:58.684 --> 00:07:02.712
Mountain hut, high leg, rock 'n" roll!

00:07:03.256 --> 00:07:05.200
Mountain hut, high leg, rock 'n" roll!

00:07:05.224 --> 00:07:06.101
<i>Mountain hut, high leg, rock 'n' roll!
Oh, jeez, Qoo!</i>

00:07:06.125 --> 00:07:07.217
Oh, jeez, Qoo!

00:07:07.293 --> 00:07:09.193
You're a failure after all!

00:07:09.295 --> 00:07:12.458
OK! It's settled. You're
headed for the Human Realm!

00:07:12.565 --> 00:07:13.794
Hey, hold on a sec!

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:16.392
Is that what you mean by evaluation?

00:07:16.502 --> 00:07:19.494
Failed witches who haven't mastered
the least bit of magic by the age of 16...

00:07:19.605 --> 00:07:21.266
...are sent to the Human Realm.

00:07:21.374 --> 00:07:24.207
That's how we maintain a
consistent level of magical skills.

00:07:24.277 --> 00:07:25.687
That's what the evaluation is for.

00:07:25.711 --> 00:07:26.576
That's what the evaluation is for.
Huh?

00:07:26.679 --> 00:07:29.171
You get rid of the ones who
don't make the grade just...

00:07:29.248 --> 00:07:31.114
...50 you can raise your average score?

00:07:31.184 --> 00:07:33.676
This is how we've upheld
our traditions for generations.

00:07:33.786 --> 00:07:36.118
That's not what I asked you!

00:07:36.622 --> 00:07:38.351
You saw it too, Sheila!

00:07:38.424 --> 00:07:40.950
Are you saying they should die
in the Witches' Graveyard?

00:07:41.027 --> 00:07:41.550
Hey!

00:07:42.061 --> 00:07:43.119
Look, you!

00:07:44.597 --> 00:07:47.532
Try to help her out somehow!
You're a witch, aren't you?

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:49.591
Use magic to help her out!

00:07:49.702 --> 00:07:50.760
I told you before...

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:53.362
Magic should be used
to make everyone happy!

00:07:53.473 --> 00:07:55.134
There's nothing I can do.

00:07:55.374 --> 00:07:58.708
Either you can use magic or you can't.
It's one or the other.

00:07:58.811 --> 00:08:00.939
| could teach her magic 24/7,
but if she has no ability...

00:08:01.013 --> 00:08:02.845
...she can't be helped by strangers.

00:08:02.949 --> 00:08:05.975
What do you mean, stranger?
You're all comrades, aren't you?

00:08:06.052 --> 00:08:07.213
Comrades?

00:08:07.353 --> 00:08:09.947
Happiness is something to
be attained on your own.

00:08:10.056 --> 00:08:12.923
You don't have someone else
conjure it up for you!

00:08:15.361 --> 00:08:19.093
I've always been on my own. I never
think of anyone else as my comrade!

00:08:19.165 --> 00:08:20.064
Sheila...

00:08:20.867 --> 00:08:23.802
That Sheila...
What's going on with her?

00:08:24.604 --> 00:08:28.370
Sheila told me that she's been all alone
since the day she was born.

00:08:29.742 --> 00:08:32.336
There was never anybody
she could depend on, and...

00:08:32.411 --> 00:08:34.175
...she's always been on her own.

00:08:34.547 --> 00:08:38.177
That's why she tries to be
better than everyone else.

00:08:38.684 --> 00:08:41.745
She says she's gonna climb
to the top on her own ability.

00:08:49.762 --> 00:08:52.424
But why? Atelia, why would you be...

00:08:52.565 --> 00:08:55.262
Do you find it odd for me
to be capturing fairies?

00:08:55.368 --> 00:08:57.166
No, that's not what I meant...

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:59.967
Somehow, before I knew it, I started
delegating everything to others...

00:09:00.072 --> 00:09:01.938
...and perhaps I'd
forgotten along the way.

00:09:02.008 --> 00:09:04.375
To use magic with my own two hands...

00:09:04.477 --> 00:09:07.811
...and the fact that tradition should
be protected with your own hands.

00:09:07.914 --> 00:09:08.938
Atelia...

00:09:09.615 --> 00:09:11.344
Let's hurry back to
the holding facility.

00:09:11.417 --> 00:09:12.077
Yes, Atelia!

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:17.084
We now have a total of
33 of the fairy species.

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:18.982
That can't be...

00:09:19.058 --> 00:09:21.356
We will be holding the
witch evaluation as scheduled.

00:09:21.427 --> 00:09:23.361
Please notify the grand master.

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:26.292
But you're one of the Three Sages!

00:09:26.365 --> 00:09:29.198
| can't believe you'd go out
and capture fairies yourself!

00:09:29.302 --> 00:09:32.897
There was a time when we too were
apprentice witches just like her.

00:09:33.005 --> 00:09:34.803
That's all there is to it.

00:09:36.676 --> 00:09:41.637
Let tradition bring glory
to the Witch Realm!

00:09:41.781 --> 00:09:44.341
Let it bring glory!

00:09:44.584 --> 00:09:47.053
I'm gonna make it to the
other side no matter what!

00:09:48.521 --> 00:09:50.387
Qoo! Give it all you've got!

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:54.053
Remember what I told you! In the end,
all you have to do is believe!

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:58.256
As long as you believe with all
your heart, anyone can use magic!

00:10:01.367 --> 00:10:04.268
How dare you even think of escaping
when you're nothing but lowly fairies!

00:10:04.337 --> 00:10:06.032
That idiot Atelia may be
okay with that...

00:10:06.138 --> 00:10:08.573
...but no way are we gonna
let you get away with it!

00:10:12.678 --> 00:10:14.339
What's going on?

00:10:24.256 --> 00:10:25.052
Huh?

00:10:26.192 --> 00:10:28.889
What's the hold up? You're up next!

00:10:28.961 --> 00:10:30.952
Come on, get it over with!

00:10:31.964 --> 00:10:36.333
District A... Qoo. I'm going
to cast the petrification spell.

00:10:37.303 --> 00:10:40.603
Mountain hut, high leg, rock 'n' roll.

00:10:41.741 --> 00:10:44.608
Mountain hut, high leg, rock 'n' roll.

00:10:45.177 --> 00:10:46.888
Mountain hut, high leg, rock 'n' roll.

00:10:46.912 --> 00:10:47.606
Mountain hut, high leg, rock 'n' roll.
Hey, hey...

00:10:47.747 --> 00:10:48.323
Give us a break, will you?

00:10:48.347 --> 00:10:50.372
Give us a break, will you?
Mountain hut, high leg, rock 'n' roll.

00:10:50.449 --> 00:10:52.611
We're really backed up, you know...

00:10:53.119 --> 00:10:55.611
No need for you to continue.

00:10:56.288 --> 00:10:59.986
Qoo. We have decided to
send you to the Human Realm.

00:11:02.828 --> 00:11:05.695
Hey, you!
Can't you see she's not done yet?

00:11:05.765 --> 00:11:07.859
It doesn't matter
how many times she tries.

00:11:10.336 --> 00:11:12.395
B-B-B-Bad news, Atelia!

00:11:12.538 --> 00:11:14.768
A fairy is attacking!

00:11:32.892 --> 00:11:35.884
Tweeny Witches

00:11:40.399 --> 00:11:44.859
<i>Hydra's Attack</i>

00:11:54.013 --> 00:11:56.812
We're not done with the evaluation yet!
What about Qoo?

00:11:56.882 --> 00:11:59.180
This is no time to pick a fight!

00:12:00.086 --> 00:12:02.180
Don't just stand there!

00:12:04.457 --> 00:12:05.447
Arusu!

00:12:06.525 --> 00:12:09.119
Why is the fairy so out of control?

00:12:09.228 --> 00:12:11.959
Aren't they supposed to be
at the holding facility?

00:12:12.031 --> 00:12:12.862
Why?

00:12:13.199 --> 00:12:16.965
Just how are you going to explain
this situation to the civilians?

00:12:17.069 --> 00:12:19.595
It was you who warned
that we'd be finished...

00:12:19.705 --> 00:12:23.471
...if the general population found out
about the fairies escaping, Atelia.

00:12:23.609 --> 00:12:25.043
| am well aware of that.

00:12:25.111 --> 00:12:27.478
Well, if that's the case,
then think up a solution!

00:12:27.947 --> 00:12:32.783
Right now it doesn't even matter
what we're going to tell the public.

00:12:32.918 --> 00:12:33.680
What?

00:12:34.386 --> 00:12:38.846
That fairy's headed for the
holding facility, is it not?

00:12:39.058 --> 00:12:42.551
Most likely, it's going there
to rescue its offspring.

00:12:42.928 --> 00:12:44.589
What did you say?

00:12:52.171 --> 00:12:53.297
Arusu!

00:13:07.486 --> 00:13:08.419
Atelia!

00:13:09.021 --> 00:13:10.989
We should use the
petrification spell to...

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:13.024
That is no longer a viable spell.

00:13:13.526 --> 00:13:17.326
We exhausted our supply of
fairy elements during the evaluation.

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:19.095
I know!

00:13:19.765 --> 00:13:20.391
Sheila!

00:13:20.766 --> 00:13:23.895
Qoo... The apprentice witch
you're sending to the Human Realm!

00:13:24.003 --> 00:13:27.405
She failed to do the petrification spell,
so I'll bet she's got some left!

00:13:31.577 --> 00:13:32.601
Belly button lint?

00:13:32.711 --> 00:13:34.805
Yeah, the culops fairy's belly button...

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:36.439
Give it to me now!

00:13:37.616 --> 00:13:39.675
The hydra's headed towards
the holding facility.

00:13:39.752 --> 00:13:42.881
We've got to petrify it and stop it in
its tracks, or we'll be in big trouble!

00:13:42.988 --> 00:13:45.355
Listen to me! The entire
Witch Realm is in danger!

00:13:45.891 --> 00:13:49.156
If we save it, maybe they will cancel
your banishment to the Human Realm.

00:13:49.261 --> 00:13:51.855
Oh, yeah? That would be great, huh, Qoo?

00:13:52.431 --> 00:13:54.297
So hurry up and give me the source...

00:13:54.433 --> 00:13:55.298
It's gone.

00:13:56.468 --> 00:13:57.958
I don't have it.

00:13:58.270 --> 00:13:59.829
You don't have it?

00:14:00.139 --> 00:14:02.005
But you couldn't use it!

00:14:02.107 --> 00:14:04.098
I think I dropped it somewhere.

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:04.870
What?

00:14:35.107 --> 00:14:36.768
Everyone, just stay calm!

00:14:36.842 --> 00:14:40.608
We're doing everything we can
to get the situation under control.

00:14:40.746 --> 00:14:42.646
So please, don't panic!

00:14:43.215 --> 00:14:46.412
What in the world is Atelia doing?

00:14:47.152 --> 00:14:49.985
Apparently, the special squad is
on its way to the holding facility.

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:56.954
Things will be different
this time around!

00:14:57.029 --> 00:14:57.860
Nerabu!

00:14:57.963 --> 00:14:59.192
Whenever you're ready!

00:14:59.298 --> 00:15:02.165
That creature really did
a number on us before.

00:15:02.268 --> 00:15:05.829
Just capturing it would be too merciful...
Not enough to soothe my soul!

00:15:11.477 --> 00:15:12.273
Got it!

00:15:42.574 --> 00:15:43.234
Hey!

00:15:43.409 --> 00:15:45.503
| know we've got to find
that belly button lint...

00:15:45.577 --> 00:15:48.103
...but will the fairies be okay
if you turn them into stone?

00:15:48.213 --> 00:15:49.408
What do you mean by okay?

00:15:49.515 --> 00:15:52.815
I mean can you turn them back?

00:15:52.985 --> 00:15:56.785
Petrification is a powerful spell.
Turning them back won't be easy.

00:15:56.922 --> 00:16:00.620
For real? Then you know what,
I'm totally against this!

00:16:03.262 --> 00:16:04.161
Found it!

00:16:07.199 --> 00:16:08.598
All right! Ready?

00:16:08.701 --> 00:16:09.293
Yes.

00:16:13.906 --> 00:16:15.203
Can you get closer?

00:16:15.274 --> 00:16:18.801
No. If we get any closer,
we'll be swallowed up.

00:16:27.453 --> 00:16:28.511
Arusu!

00:16:33.025 --> 00:16:33.890
Qoo!

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:35.904
First, the source.

00:16:35.928 --> 00:16:37.293
First, the source.
What did you just say?

00:16:37.463 --> 00:16:38.487
Hand over the source!

00:16:38.564 --> 00:16:40.658
The stupid belly button lint
doesn't matter right now!

00:16:40.733 --> 00:16:41.791
Of course it matters!

00:16:41.867 --> 00:16:44.893
We've got to petrify the hydra or
it will mean trouble for everybody!

00:16:45.037 --> 00:16:46.368
So you tricked us...

00:16:47.039 --> 00:16:49.770
The Witch Realm is in danger.
What else could I do?

00:16:49.875 --> 00:16:50.774
Sheila...

00:16:52.144 --> 00:16:53.976
What do you mean everybody?

00:16:54.513 --> 00:16:57.039
If you can't even save
a single person...

00:16:57.383 --> 00:17:00.284
...then there's no way that
you can save everybody!

00:17:01.220 --> 00:17:01.812
Hey!

00:17:02.154 --> 00:17:03.212
Arusu!

00:17:18.771 --> 00:17:20.068
Qoo!

00:17:27.513 --> 00:17:28.503
What should I do?

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:30.947
At this rate, I'm gonna
get swallowed up too.

00:17:33.252 --> 00:17:34.777
Sheila, do you have the source?

00:17:34.887 --> 00:17:35.877
She's got it.

00:17:36.422 --> 00:17:37.298
Hand it over!

00:17:37.322 --> 00:17:38.414
Hand it over!
Why don't you shut up!

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:40.686
If petrifying means so much to you...

00:17:42.361 --> 00:17:43.671
...I'll just do it for you!

00:17:43.695 --> 00:17:45.322
...I'll just do it for you!
Arusu, don't tell me you're...

00:17:48.233 --> 00:17:52.101
Mountain hut, high leg, rock 'n" roll!

00:17:54.039 --> 00:17:55.006
Arusu!

00:18:32.211 --> 00:18:36.170
Please, you've got to...
You've got to save Arusu!

00:18:37.216 --> 00:18:41.551
| cannot use magic to turn her back
without a long lock of a witch's hair.

00:18:41.787 --> 00:18:42.379
But...

00:18:42.521 --> 00:18:44.080
It can't be helped.

00:18:44.223 --> 00:18:47.523
It's her own fault for petrifying herself
without thinking of the consequences.

00:18:47.593 --> 00:18:48.560
But...

00:18:49.128 --> 00:18:51.961
No matter how she went about it,
in the end, she still managed...

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:54.465
...to save the Witch Realm
from a grave crisis.

00:18:55.667 --> 00:18:56.634
Arusu!

00:18:59.204 --> 00:18:59.981
Please wait!

00:19:00.005 --> 00:19:00.733
Please wait!
Qoo!

00:19:00.839 --> 00:19:01.829
What is it?

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:04.568
Please let me do it.

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:06.808
But you don't have the skills...

00:19:06.879 --> 00:19:09.678
It's got to be me...
| have to be the one to do it.

00:19:12.584 --> 00:19:17.545
<i>Theta eta gamma iota
epsilon epsilon zetal</i>

00:19:21.126 --> 00:19:22.093
No way...

00:19:24.196 --> 00:19:25.994
Hey, what did I tell you?

00:19:26.231 --> 00:19:30.134
As long as you believe with
all your heart, anyone can use magic!

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:32.360
Arusu!

00:19:32.504 --> 00:19:33.801
Arusu!

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:38.704
Hey, old lady, you won't be sending her
to the Human Realm now, right?

00:19:38.777 --> 00:19:41.576
Why, you... So you were
planning this all along!

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:46.078
That's right. This means Qoo's not
a total failure at magic anymore!

00:19:46.151 --> 00:19:48.313
That's the story, folks!

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:50.219
It's fine with me.

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.724
I'm so happy for you, Qoo!

00:19:54.126 --> 00:19:54.991
Thanks!

00:19:56.495 --> 00:19:58.930
Magic to make people happy, my foot!

00:19:59.031 --> 00:19:59.497
Huh?

00:20:00.032 --> 00:20:01.329
Unacceptable...

00:20:01.967 --> 00:20:04.436
I'll never accept anything like that!

00:20:16.782 --> 00:20:24.746
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:32.990
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:34.166 --> 00:20:42.166
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:43.408 --> 00:20:48.972
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:49.081 --> 00:20:53.314
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:54.086 --> 00:20:58.319
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:20:58.423 --> 00:21:02.985
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:03.195 --> 00:21:08.361
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:08.467 --> 00:21:11.528
Let's hope it does.

00:21:13.005 --> 00:21:17.636
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:17.743 --> 00:21:20.235
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:20.345 --> 00:21:28.345
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:29.521 --> 00:21:35.255
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:39.524
So we might as well
Just make one of our own!
